  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding the plans hereby approved, the windows and doors shall be of timber construction,&amp;nbsp;unless otherwise first approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (or any order revoking and re-enacting that order with or without modification), no window(s)/door(s) shall be installed in the rear elevation(s) of the development hereby permitted without the prior permission in writing of the local planning authority.",
    "&lt;p&gt;The use of the outbuilding hereby permitted shall not be occupied or used at any time as a separate residential unit or for primary living purposes and shall remain in an incidental use to the host dwellinghouse at Weathertrees South Hill Avenue, South Harrow, Harrow, HA1 3NZ. &amp;nbsp;Any other material change of use would require planning permission.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding the plans hereby approved, the brickwork bond (ie.&amp;nbsp;the arrangement of bricks) type, size, colour, face bond, pointing, coursing, jointing, profile and texture shall match the existing on the dwelling,&amp;nbsp;unless otherwise first approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
